# Content that must not enter container images.
#
# Measurements on 2026-09-05 showed that `COPY sdk-python/` and `COPY mcp-server/`
# pulled 102 MB and 129 MB into image layers, including 91 MB and 119 MB virtual
# environments plus caches and build directories. Removing those directories later in
# the same layer did not reduce the image: consumers still downloaded 231 MB of waste to
# obtain 69 MB of packages.
.venv/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
build/
**/build/
dist/
**/dist/

# Local and internal content has no place in runtime images. Some of it is also outside
# the public repository slice.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.superpowers/
docs/
site/
# Preparation stages need the installer/backend locks and the runtime cleanup helper.
# Keep every other script outside the context; do not allow the entire scripts/ tree.
scripts/*
!scripts/container-build-requirements.lock
!scripts/container-pip-requirements.lock
!scripts/prepare-python-runtime.py
!scripts/prepare-python-filesystem.py
!scripts/prepare-relay-runtime.py
agent-service/
relay/target/
**/node_modules/
*.log
*.tar
*.tar.gz
